    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c8dca19fca842f7",
      "translationZh": "该模型可按需在 Inference API 上加载。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "716b52c42e952750",
      "translationZh": "实验",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bb3b880201808c2",
      "translationZh": "我们在四个基准数据集上评估 TAPEX：WikiSQL（弱监督）、WikiTableQuestions、SQA 和 TabFact。前三个是表格问答，最后一个是表格事实核查，都要求对表格和自然语言做联合推理。下面是最具挑战性的 WikiTableQuestions 数据集中的一些例子：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "289aff12b04274cb",
      "translationZh": "问题",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2a3aa602762a782",
      "translationZh": "答案",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea2520a2975d2084",
      "translationZh": "根据表格，spicy horse 制作的最后一个标题是什么？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ff075a4e1da3375",
      "translationZh": "Akaneiro: Demon Hunters",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83fa56d57a6343a1",
      "translationZh": "coleraine academical institution 与 royal school dungannon 的亚军数量差是多少？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "323d02548ed56f3a",
      "translationZh": "greenstreet 出演的第一部和最后一部电影是什么？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61ec40d09c07b646",
      "translationZh": "The Maltese Falcon, Malaya",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12906bd28edbf75c",
      "translationZh": "arasay thondike 在哪届奥运会上没有进入前 20？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2691174d60e0089d",
      "translationZh": "哪个播出方有 3 个剧名但只有 1 集？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a62c5e4623b1687",
      "translationZh": "Channel 4",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c8710e133bd30bd",
      "translationZh": "实验结果表明，TAPEX 大幅超越以往的表格预训练方法，⭐在全部基准上取得了新的最先进结果⭐。包括：弱监督 WikiSQL 的 denotation 准确率提升到 89.6%（比 SOTA +2.3%，比 BART +3.8%）、TabFact 准确率 84.2%（比 SOTA +3.2%，比 BART +3.0%）、SQA denotation 准确率 74.5%（比 SOTA +3.5%，比 BART +15.9%），以及 WikiTableQuestion denotation 准确率 57.5%（比 SOTA +4.8%，比 BART +19.5%）。据我们所知，这是首个利用合成可执行程序做预训练并在多个下游任务上取得新的最先进结果的工作。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3329304ae130b9cb",
      "translationZh": "与以往表格预训练的比较",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c499471804aaf2fe",
      "translationZh": "最早的表格预训练工作——Google Research 的 TAPAS（也可在 🤗 Transformers 中获得）和 Meta AI 的 TaBERT——揭示了收集更多领域自适应数据可以改善下游性能。但这些以往的工作主要采用通用预训练任务，如语言建模或其变体。TAPEX 探索了另一条路径：牺牲预训练来源的自然性，换取一个领域自适应的预训练任务，即 SQL 执行。BERT、TAPAS/TaBERT 与我们的 TAPEX 的图形化对比如下。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcc75500576259ec",
      "translationZh": "我们认为 SQL 执行任务更接近下游的表格问答任务，尤其是从结构化推理能力的角度看。想象你面对一条 SQL 查询 SELECT City ORDER BY Year 和一个自然问题 Sort all cities by year：SQL 查询与该问题所需的推理路径是相似的，只是 SQL 比自然语言更僵硬。如果一个语言模型能被预训练得忠实“执行” SQL 查询并产生正确结果，那它对具有类似意图的自然语言应当有深入的理解。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "010f0e3dd2ad4ad6",
      "translationZh": "效率如何？与以往预训练相比，这种预训练方法的效率如何？上图给出了答案：与以往的表格预训练方法 TaBERT 相比，TAPEX 只用 2% 的预训练语料就能获得 2% 的提升，加速近 50 倍！使用更大的预训练语料（例如 500 万个 <SQL, 表格, 执行结果> 对），下游数据集上的性能还会更好。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04cdfce09f2d28d4",
      "translationZh": "本博介绍了 TAPEX——一种表格预训练方法，其语料通过采样 SQL 查询及其执行结果自动合成。TAPEX 通过在多样、大规模、高质量的合成语料上学习神经 SQL 执行器，解决了表格预训练中的数据稀缺难题。四个下游数据集的实验结果表明，TAPEX 大幅超越以往的表格预训练方法，并具有更高的预训练效率。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b10117f1d65848c8",
      "translationZh": "要点",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82cf85ca4ab094f9",
      "translationZh": "从 TAPEX 的成功我们能学到什么？我的建议是——尤其如果你想执行高效的持续预训练——可以尝试这些做法：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01c56b0f5e91ae11",
      "translationZh": "合成一个精确的小语料，而不是从互联网挖掘一个大而嘈杂的语料。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f381130850d765d",
      "translationZh": "用程序模拟领域自适应技能，而不是用自然语言句子做通用语言建模。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
